{
  "html": "<div style=\"margin-top:10px;opacity:.75;font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\">Everything Alerts needs is set up.</div><div style=\"padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.2)\"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\"><strong><a href=\"/app/alerts_channel\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Channels</a></strong> <span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#16a34a;border:1px solid #16a34a\">Set up</span></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0;opacity:.75;font-size:13px\">1 channel: the bell and email only. &middot; Next: Optional: add Slack, Teams, a webhook or PagerDuty.</span></span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.2)\"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\"><strong><a href=\"/app/alerts_type\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Alert types</a></strong> <span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#16a34a;border:1px solid #16a34a\">Set up</span></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0;opacity:.75;font-size:13px\">42 types declared by the installed qbits.</span></span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.2)\"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\"><strong><a href=\"/app/alerts_monitor\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Monitors</a></strong> <span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#16a34a;border:1px solid #16a34a\">Set up</span></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0;opacity:.75;font-size:13px\">4 monitors turned on.</span></span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.2)\"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\"><strong><a href=\"/app/alerts_group\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Groups</a></strong> <span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;border:1px solid #6b7280\">Optional</span></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0;opacity:.75;font-size:13px\">4 groups, none with an owner team. &middot; Next: Give a group an Owner Team so alerts that nobody subscribed to still reach someone.</span></span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.2)\"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\"><strong><a href=\"/app/alerts_team\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Teams</a></strong> <span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;border:1px solid #6b7280\">Optional</span></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0;opacity:.75;font-size:13px\">No team. &middot; Next: Add a team and its members to subscribe people together or to own a group.</span></span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.2)\"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\"><strong><a href=\"/app/alerts_subscription\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Subscriptions</a></strong> <span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#16a34a;border:1px solid #16a34a\">Set up</span></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0;opacity:.75;font-size:13px\">1 subscription turned on.</span></span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.2)\"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\"><strong><a href=\"/app/alerts_escalation_policy\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Escalation policies</a></strong> <span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;border:1px solid #6b7280\">Optional</span></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0;opacity:.75;font-size:13px\">None: alerts are reminded, not escalated. &middot; Next: Add a policy and its steps, then pick it on a type or group.</span></span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.2)\"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\"><strong><a href=\"/app/alerts_mute\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px\">Mutes and maintenance</a></strong> <span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;border:1px solid #6b7280\">Optional</span></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0;opacity:.75;font-size:13px\">Nothing is muted. &middot; Next: Add a window before planned maintenance.</span></span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.2)\"><span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:10px;row-gap:2px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0\"><strong>Scheduler</strong> <span style=\"display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#16a34a;border:1px solid #16a34a\">Set up</span></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0;opacity:.75;font-size:13px\">Monitors, delivery, digests and escalation run on the demoScheduler scheduler.</span></span></div>",
  "type": "html",
  "text": "Everything Alerts needs is set up.\nChannels Set up1 channel: the bell and email only. · Next: Optional: add Slack, Teams, a webhook or PagerDuty.\nAlert types Set up42 types declared by the installed qbits.\nMonitors Set up4 monitors turned on.\nGroups Optional4 groups, none with an owner team. · Next: Give a group an Owner Team so alerts that nobody subscribed to still reach someone.\nTeams OptionalNo team. · Next: Add a team and its members to subscribe people together or to own a group.\nSubscriptions Set up1 subscription turned on.\nEscalation policies OptionalNone: alerts are reminded, not escalated. · Next: Add a policy and its steps, then pick it on a type or group.\nMutes and maintenance OptionalNothing is muted. · Next: Add a window before planned maintenance.\nScheduler Set upMonitors, delivery, digests and escalation run on the demoScheduler scheduler."
}
